<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>文献链接</title>

<style>
body{
  font-family:Arial, sans-serif;
  background:#f5f6fa;
  margin:0;
  text-align:center;
}

h1{
  margin-top:60px;
}

.links{
  margin-top:40px;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:center;
  gap:20px;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
}

a.card{
  padding:15px 25px;
  background:white;
  border-radius:12px;
  text-decoration:none;
  color:#333;
  box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  transition:0.2s;
  font-weight:600;
}

a.card:hover{
  transform:translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
}

.back{
  margin-top:50px;
  display:block;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<h1>📚 文献主页</h1>

<div class="links">
  <a class="card" href="https://pubs.acs.org/journal/jacsat" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
    🔬 JACS
  </a>

  <a class="card" href="https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/journal/15213773" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
    🧪 Angewandte Chemie
  </a>

  <a class="card" href="https://www.nature.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
    🌍 Nature
  </a>
</div>

<a class="back" href="index.html">← 返回首页</a>

</body>
</html>
